Subject: [PATCH] constant: allow registering extra safe paths at runtime

Mishka 不带 cmfa 构建标签（app/build.gradle.kts 里已说明原因：cmfa 会跳过
Linux socket-owner 查询，metadata.Uid 恒为 0，PROCESS-NAME / 按 UID 的规则失效），
所以 IsSafePath 里 `features.CMFA` 那条快捷通道对本定制不生效。

订阅导入校验跑在 app 进程内（libmihomo.so 的 JNI 路径），homeDir 被设成
files/mihomo/geodata（只为让内核找到 GeoIP/GeoSite/ASN），而 provider 文件
落在 files/mihomo/processing/providers/ —— 不是 homeDir 的子路径，于是
adapter/provider/parser.go 直接返回 ErrNotSafePath。

SAFE_PATHS 环境变量只在 constant 包 init 时读一次（.so dlopen 的瞬间），
Android 侧没有可靠时机去设置，这里补一个运行时注册入口，由 mishkaCoreInit 调用。
---
diff --git a/constant/path.go b/constant/path.go
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/constant/path.go
+++ b/constant/path.go
@@ -64,6 +64,17 @@ func SetHomeDir(root string) {
 	Path.homeDir = root
 }
 
+// AddSafePaths registers extra directories accepted by IsSafePath at runtime.
+// SAFE_PATHS is only read once during package init, which an in-process (JNI) host
+// that learns its sandbox paths after dlopen cannot hook into.
+func AddSafePaths(paths ...string) {
+	for _, sp := range paths {
+		if sp != "" {
+			Path.safePaths = append(Path.safePaths, sp)
+		}
+	}
+}
+
 // SetConfig is used to set the configuration file
 func SetConfig(file string) {
 	Path.configFile = file
